{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41626","headline":"蒲门戍观海作 · 陈陶","name":"蒲门戍观海作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"廓落溟涨晓，蒲门郁苍苍。\n登楼礼东君，旭日生扶桑。\n毫厘见蓬瀛，含吐金银光。\n草木露未曦，蜃楼气若藏。\n欲游蟠桃国，虑涉魑魅乡。\n徐市惑秦朝，何人在岩廊。\n惜哉千童子，葬骨於眇茫。\n恭闻槎客言，东池接天潢。\n即此聘牛女，曰祈长寿方。\n灵津水清浅，余亦慕修航。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}